    "content": "<!-- wp:cil/page-head {\"eyebrow\":\"All faiths and backgrounds · Six languages\",\"title\":\"Religious and cultural circumcision\",\"lede\":\"Religious and cultural circumcision is a large part of our work. We welcome families and adult patients from all faiths and backgrounds and aim to provide a respectful clinical service that understands the importance of the decision.\",\"reviewedBy\":\"\\u003ca href=\\u0022https://circumcision-london-wp.vercel.app/team/#haidar\\u0022\\u003eDr Haidar Al-Ali, BDS, MFDS RCPS (Glasg)\\u003c/a\\u003e, September 2026\",\"crumbs\":[{\"label\":\"Who we see\",\"href\":\"https://circumcision-london-wp.vercel.app/babies/\"},{\"label\":\"Religious and cultural\",\"href\":\"\"}]} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cil/section {\"size\":\"section-sm\",\"band\":\"\",\"wrap\":\"wrap\"} --><section class=\"wp-block-cil-section section-sm\"><div class=\"wrap\"><!-- wp:cil/split {\"reverse\":false} --><div class=\"wp-block-cil-split split\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"body-text\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-group body-text\"><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Our Muslim practitioners can carry out circumcision in accordance with the Sunnah. The same clinical standards apply whatever the reason for circumcision: assessment first, an age-appropriate method, local anaesthetic, written aftercare and access to follow-up support.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>We also understand that it is customary to do male circumcision is some cultures such as Africa, Philippines, Fiji and other parts of the world.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>We see patients from London, elsewhere in the UK and from abroad. If you are travelling a long distance, contact us before booking so we can discuss timing, documentation and follow-up arrangements.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group --><!-- wp:cil/spec-panel {\"eyebrow\":\"Practical detail\",\"rows\":[{\"k\":\"Sunnah practice\",\"v\":\"Yes, by our Muslim practitioners\"},{\"k\":\"All faiths\",\"v\":\"Families and adult patients welcome\"},{\"k\":\"Anaesthetic\",\"v\":\"Local anaesthetic\"},{\"k\":\"Aftercare\",\"v\":\"Written aftercare and follow-up support\"},{\"k\":\"Languages\",\"v\":\"English, Arabic, Urdu, Hindi, Punjabi and Turkish\"},{\"k\":\"Setting\",\"v\":\"CQC registered clinic\"}],\"note\":\"\"} /--></div><!-- /wp:cil/split --></div></section><!-- /wp:cil/section -->\n\n<!-- wp:cil/cta-band {\"title\":\"Ask about a date\",\"text\":\"If you are travelling a long distance, contact us before booking so we can discuss timing, documentation and follow-up arrangements.\",\"eyebrow\":\"Talk to us\",\"ctaLabel\":\"Book a consultation\",\"ctaUrl\":\"https://circumcision-london-wp.vercel.app/book/\",\"phoneLabel\":\"Call 020 8951 3794\",\"phoneUrl\":\"tel:+442089513794\",\"cardTitle\":\"Would you rather write than speak?\",\"cardHtml\":\"\\u003cp style=\\u0022margin-top:10px\\u0022\\u003eA phone call asks you to be fluent and composed in the moment. \\u003ca href=\\u0022https://wa.me/447886779958\\u0022 rel=\\u0022noopener\\u0022 target=\\u0022_blank\\u0022 data-track=\\u0022whatsapp-cta\\u0022 style=\\u0022color:var(\\u002d\\u002dblue-deep)\\u0022\\u003eWhatsApp\\u003c/a\\u003e does not. You can take your time, translate, and forward the answer to whoever else in the family needs to see it.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp style=\\u0022margin-top:12px\\u0022\\u003eWe reply during opening hours, and we are used to the questions people feel awkward asking out loud.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cil/section {\"size\":\"section\",\"band\":\"bg-warm\",\"wrap\":\"wrap\"} --><section class=\"wp-block-cil-section section bg-warm\"><div class=\"wrap\"><!-- wp:cil/section-head {\"eyebrow\":\"By age\",\"heading\":\"The procedure itself, by age group\",\"lede\":\"\",\"display\":\"d-2\"} /--><!-- wp:cil/group-cards {\"level\":3,\"exclude\":\"\",\"banded\":false,\"items\":[{\"href\":\"https://circumcision-london-wp.vercel.app/babies/\",\"title\":\"Babies and toddlers\",\"age\":\"Best under one month old\",\"price\":\"From £200\",\"cta\":\"Baby circumcision, from £200\",\"blurb\":\"The ring method, Plastibell or Circumplast, under local anaesthetic. About ten minutes, no stitches, and you take him home straight afterwards.\"},{\"href\":\"https://circumcision-london-wp.vercel.app/children/\",\"title\":\"Children and teenagers\",\"age\":\"One to seventeen years\",\"price\":\"From £280\",\"cta\":\"Circumcision for boys, from £280\",\"blurb\":\"The forceps guided method with thermal cautery, under local anaesthetic. School holiday appointments book up quickly.\"},{\"href\":\"https://circumcision-london-wp.vercel.app/adults/\",\"title\":\"Adult men\",\"age\":\"Eighteen and over\",\"price\":\"From £680\",\"cta\":\"Adult circumcision, from £680\",\"blurb\":\"Forceps guided, under local anaesthetic. You stay awake and can talk to the doctor, watch television or listen to music throughout.\"}]} /--></div></section><!-- /wp:cil/section -->"
}
